"description": "Worthington Enterprises, Inc. engages in the manufacturing of metal products. It operates through the Consumer Products and Building Products segments. The Consumer Products segment consists of products in the tools, outdoor living, and celebrations end markets with owned and licensed brands. The Building Products segment provides pressurized containment solutions, ceiling suspension systems, and light gauge metal framing products. The company was founded by John H. McConnell in 1955 and is headquartered in Columbus, OH.",
